---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME, CONTACT, RC_NUMBER } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Windek Oil and Gas Limited"
  description="How Windek Oil and Gas Limited collects, uses and protects personal data submitted through this website, including enquiries and career applications."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' },
  ]}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    intro="How we handle personal data submitted through this website."
    image="/images/about-operations.jpg"
    imageAlt="Windek Oil and Gas operations team reviewing field engineering work"
  />

  <section class="section-y bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto gutter">
      <article class="prose-windek text-slate-600">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">
          Last updated: 1 October 2026. Applies to {COMPANY_NAME} (RC {RC_NUMBER.replace('RC', '')}).
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          {COMPANY_NAME} is a company registered in Nigeria, headquartered at
          {CONTACT.address.full}. For questions about this policy or the data we hold, contact us at
          <a href={CONTACT.emailHref}>{CONTACT.email}</a> or on <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phoneHref}`}>{CONTACT.phone}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
        <p>We only collect information you choose to give us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact enquiry details: your name, email address, phone number, company and the content of your message.</li>
          <li>Career enquiry details: your CV, technical certifications and the experience you describe in your application.</li>
          <li>Basic technical data about your visit, such as browser type, device type and pages viewed, collected through analytics.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not ask for and do not seek special category personal data through this website.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Why we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry, prepare a quotation or assess a project requirement.</li>
          <li>To consider your application for employment or industrial training.</li>
          <li>To understand how the website is used so we can improve it.</li>
          <li>To meet legal, tax and regulatory record-keeping obligations that apply to a Nigerian registered company.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry records are retained for as long as needed to deal with the enquiry and any
          resulting commercial relationship, and afterwards for the period required by applicable
          law. Career applications are retained for the duration of recruitment and a reasonable
          period afterwards, unless you ask us to delete them sooner.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses Google Analytics to measure aggregate usage. IP addresses are anonymised
          before storage. You can opt out using the Google Analytics browser add-on, and your
          choice is respected by this website.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Sharing your information</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We share it only where necessary: with service
          providers that host or support the website and process enquiries on our behalf, and where
          disclosure is required by Nigerian law, a regulator or a court. Those providers act under
          confidentiality obligations.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what personal data we hold about you, request a correction or deletion, or
          object to how we use it. Contact us at
          <a href={CONTACT.emailHref}>{CONTACT.email}</a> and we will respond within a reasonable
          time. Where we hold your data because a legal obligation requires it, we will explain why
          we cannot delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          The website uses essential cookies required for the site to function, and analytics cookies
          that help us understand aggregate usage. Analytics cookies are only set once you have
          interacted with or visited the site.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal data
          submitted through this website, including restricting access to staff who need it and
          using HTTPS for data in transit.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The revision date at the top of this page
          shows the current version, and the page URL will remain unchanged.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {COMPANY_NAME}<br />
          {CONTACT.address.full}<br />
          <a href={CONTACT.emailHref}>{CONTACT.email}</a> · <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phoneHref}`}>{CONTACT.phone}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>